914 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UI\057UX Design \046 Outreach Sub\055team Lead \174 Olin Assistive Technology Braille Device \174 Fall 2025 \055 Present\nLead a 7\055person sub\055team connecting user research to hardware design for a braille learning device for students\056\nRan 4 co\055design sessions with 12 users \0503 blind educators\054 9 braille students\051\054 turning feedback into design requirements\054 including a new speech to Braille feature\056\nDesigned the full exterior housing assembly in Onshape through to a finalized form factor\056\nCoordinated across firmware and hardware sub\055teams to manage spatial constraints for integration\056\n\nCurriculum Development \046 Game Design Intern \174 Qweebi \050Remote\051 \174 Summer 2026\073 part\055time Fall 2026 \055 Present\nDesigned two Engineering Design Process challenges \050wind turbine and solar energy\051 for grades 3\0558 on Chromebooks\056\nRapidly prototyped interactive mock\055ups with AI\055assisted coding to test challenge concepts before full development\056\nRan usability tests with 11 students and involved 2 teachers in curriculum development to find gaps in existing lessons and set learning outcomes\056\n)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 915 0 R
     /Pg 904 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

