918 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Form 3 Resin Cure Sensor \174 Formlabs Hackathon \174 Spring 2026\nOn a team of 4\054 built a sensor that detects resin layer curing by integrating a coplanar dielectric sensor into a Form 3 build plate\056\nDesigned the modified build plate in Onshape to hold a custom PCB impedance comb\056 The sensor reliably detected the curing of each resin layer\056\n\nWall\055Climbing Thrust Robot \174 Course Project \174 Fall 2026 \055 Present\nDesigning a robot that uses propeller thrust to both adhere to and drive on vertical surfaces\056\nDesigned and prototyped 3 chassis iterations and a thrust\055vectoring gimbal\nPerformed hand calcs to find the minimum 1\0568 kg of thrust needed for each propeller for wall adhesion\056\n\nAmphibious Vehicle \174 Fall 2026\nConverting a refurbished go\055kart drivetrain and steering system into an amphibious vehicle\054 designing a PVC frame and wooden hull in Onshape around it\056\nSized the hull with buoyancy hand calcs to float 330 lbs with 6 inches of freeboard\056\n\nAutonomous Robot Navigation \046 Machine Vision \174 Computational Robotics \174 Fall 2026 \055 Present\nProgrammed a Neato robot platform \050Raspberry Pi\054 ROS2\054 Python\051 for autonomous behaviors\056\nImplemented a particle filter to localize the robot on a known map from lidar scans\056\nDeveloped a machine\055vision robot with OpenCV that responds to hand gestures and uses object detection to track and follow markers\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 919 0 R
     /Pg 904 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

